{"w":2400,"h":3396,"lines":[{"y":0.030523255562214247,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"Test 2","w":0.061728394826253266,"c":1,"x":0.10493827124256612},{"w":0.17695472717285154,"t":"Questions 14-16","x":0.10493827414070306,"h":0.014562276002234698,"y":0.078488371951227265,"c":1},{"h":0.018895348053517669,"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","c":1,"x":0.10288065263712715,"y":0.11482558177957558,"w":0.3703703816731771},{"y":0.14823949079603349,"w":0.57865224202473953,"c":1,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 14-16 on your answer sheet.","h":0.021851677776646761,"x":0.10470665860052941},{"h":0.021274754240038218,"y":0.1842341995286747,"c":1,"x":0.100665749129613,"w":0.72250167846679691,"t":"14 What point does the writer make about microbes in the first paragraph?"},{"t":"They adapt quickly to their environment.","x":0.19547324788482551,"w":0.38065844217936201,"y":0.21366279054722281,"h":0.016019188192342826,"c":1},{"t":"B","h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.14814814819732522,"y":0.23110465095179844,"w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.14814814818262798,"t":"C","y":0.24854651140134165,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.016460905075073251},{"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073251,"t":"D","x":0.14814814816793073,"y":0.26598837188203095,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"w":0.40359255472819011,"t":"The risk they pose has been exaggerated.","y":0.23060669729200856,"x":0.19327315141314935,"h":0.018336201725073553},{"h":0.018236337196700592,"t":"They are more plentiful in animal life than plant life.","x":0.19122259390611818,"y":0.24841092208221216,"c":1,"w":0.48793401082356769},{"t":"They will continue to exist for longer than the human race.","x":0.19120947229689741,"y":0.26553771551063221,"w":0.55381637573242182,"c":1,"h":0.019405231318569305},{"c":1,"w":0.65463612874348953,"x":0.10063160641424047,"h":0.021270293650273331,"t":"15 In the second paragraph, the writer is impressed by the fact that","y":0.30057801838445153},{"y":0.32745465617594671,"c":1,"w":0.51475845336914061,"t":"each species tends to have vastly different microbes.","x":0.18297633517092929,"h":0.019998804278873572},{"h":0.018846381539029178,"w":0.52701863606770838,"c":1,"y":0.34602797336487323,"t":"some parts of the body contain relatively few microbes.","x":0.18918559709514729},{"c":1,"h":0.020348837575024925,"x":0.14609053501390373,"t":"c","w":0.016460905075073223,"y":0.35610465072556896},{"t":"D","c":1,"x":0.14609053502860095,"y":0.38226744164947291,"w":0.016460905075073251,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"c":1,"x":0.19127819393652884,"h":0.01928021236639843,"t":"the average individual has more microbial cells than human ones.","y":0.36301595454295665,"w":0.62363459269205723},{"x":0.19124510793875685,"y":0.38127160506014435,"w":0.64635437011718755,"h":0.019952097826487103,"t":"scientists have limited understanding of how microbial cells behave.","c":1},{"t":"16 What is the writer doing in the fifth paragraph?","h":0.019008962229087212,"w":0.48583516438802082,"c":1,"y":0.41654707641024635,"x":0.098638485054822575},{"x":0.19316999925095313,"t":"explaining how a discovery was made","w":0.36052968343098957,"h":0.019326465009098515,"y":0.4441908678809563,"c":1},{"t":"B","h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.14609053499332758,"y":0.46220930207721378,"w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1},{"x":0.18930041221265753,"t":"comparing scientists' theories about microbes","w":0.43621398925781246,"c":1,"y":0.46075581414037248,"h":0.017453844050215328},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.48110465100785449,"w":0.36419754028320306,"t":"describing confusion among scientists","c":1,"x":0.18930040656244992},{"w":0.43020874023437494,"c":1,"x":0.19125826872953886,"h":0.017617244742924809,"t":"giving details of how microbes cause disease","y":0.49713317244956545},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.89970930213906275,"c":1,"w":0.03086419741312664,"x":0.092592592548580696,"t":"44"}]}